  "help": {
    "title": "Panel amarillo · Ayuda",
    "html": "<table border=\"0\" width=\"167\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n\t<!-- habbo promo starts -->\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/common/yellow_ul.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/common/yellow_u.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"15\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/common/yellow_ur.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"bgYellowLeft\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/blank.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#E59E0F\">\n\n<p class=\"white\"><b>CHECK IN PROBLEMS?</b></p>\n\n<p>If you haven't been to Habbo Hotel before why not <a href=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/en/help/index.html\">go on a hotel tour?</a></p>\n\n<p>You'll need Shockwave to check in to the hotel, but don't worry - it's free (and safe) to download.</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"#archive-unavailable\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/homepage/getshockwave.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"91\" height=\"34\" border=\"0\" align=\"top\"></a></p>\n\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td class=\"bgYellowRight\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/blank.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td valign=\"top\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/common/yellow_dl.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td valign=\"top\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/common/yellow_d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"15\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td valign=\"top\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/common/yellow_dr.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<!-- habbo promo ends -->\n\t</table>",
    "width": 168,
    "description": "Panel lateral original de ayuda y requisitos Shockwave; se mantienen textos, enlaces y gráficos.",
    "source": "habbo/en/index.html",
    "src": "/habbo-2003/components/help.html"
  },
  "news": {
    "title": "Habbo Today · Noticias",
    "html": "<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td colspan=\"5\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/homepage/en/habbo_today.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"37\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#000000\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/blank.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/blank.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"9\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/blank.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"221\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/blank.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"9\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#000000\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/blank.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\">\n\n<p><span class=\"darkred\"><b>October 8th, 2003</b></span>&nbsp;Nifty New Newsie Goes Live! - Hola, Bonjour, Hallo and Aloha from a Far-Away Jibbi! </p>\n\n<p><span class=\"darkred\"><b>October 6, 2003</b></span>&nbsp;SMS for Credits with Virgin Mobile! You can now buy Credits using Vodafone, Orange, O2, T-Mobile and Virgin Mobile! </p>\n\n<p><span class=\"darkred\"><b>October 2, 2003</b></span>&nbsp;More Sports items in the Catalogue now! </p>\n\n<p><span class=\"darkred\"><b>October 1, 2003</b></span>&nbsp;It was a dark and dreary day...read more in this week's <a href=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/en/community/habbohoodwatch/hhw_latest/index.html\" class=\"greenish\">HabboHood Watch</a>.</p>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td colspan=\"5\"><img src=\"/habbo-2003/habbo/images/homepage/en/habbo_today_bottom.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"32\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t</table>",
    "width": 241,
    "description": "Noticias de octubre de 2003, con la cabecera y el pie ilustrados originales.",
    "source": "habbo/en/index.html",
    "src": "/habbo-2003/components/news.html"
  },
